---
description: How to write and run tests in this repo
globs: tests/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- Unit tests must not touch the network. Use `tests/helpers/fixture-server.ts` for HTTP and `tests/helpers/fake-backend.ts` for inference.
- Compile-time API checks go in `tests/types/public-api.ts`, and `bun run typecheck` enforces them.
- Real-model tests are opt-in: put them in `tests/e2e` and gate them with `env.GGML_NODE_E2E`.
- Compare large buffers with `Buffer.compare`, not `toEqual`. Vitest's deep equality is very slow on them.
- Never assert on timing. Make the failure deterministic instead.
